          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Duer",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yecu ji̱ kɔaarɛ jiök i̱, “Tin ba naath jakä dui̱r dhil tuɔɔk, kä riɛk akɛ ram in bikɛ ben kɛ jɛ! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi gɔaa ni jɛn kä ji̱ ɛn ɣöö ba päm gua̱r mi di̱i̱t yian ŋuäkdu, kä ba ji̱ yuɔr rɛy baar, kä ɣöö bi gat kɛl kä nyin tiɛtni ti̱ti̱ jakä dui̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niɛkɛ rɔ̱! Mi dui̱r dämuɔɔr ji̱ duer, luek ɛ, kä mi cɛ rɔɔdɛ ri̱t dui̱rädɛ, päli jɛ ikä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi cɛ ji̱ dui̱rä nikä bärɔw kɛ jɛn cäŋ ɔ kɛl ɔ, kä lunyɛ kä ji̱ kä bärɔw, a jio̱kɛ ji̱ i̱, ‘Cä duer,’ bɛ yi̱k pälikä.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋa̱th",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu jaak Kuäär ni Yecu jiök i̱, “Rep ŋa̱thda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuäär wee i̱, “Mi ta̱yɛ kɛ ŋa̱th mi ce̱tkɛ kuɛ̈ɛ̈ mi duŋ tiit, dee yɛn jiath pi̱li̱i̱r ɛmɔ jiök i̱, ‘Cuni rɔɔdu raar, kä pith rɔɔdu baar,’ kä bɛ ruacdun liŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "La̱t kuanyä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ɛŋa kä yɛ, mi dee ci läätdɛ luny jɔk guäth puɔ̱r rɛy kakä kiɛ yien deet, mi bi jɛ jiök i̱, ‘Bër ɛn täämɛ, kä nyuuri bi mi̱th?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ci yɛn dee jiök ni jɛ i̱, ‘Riali mi̱eth ikä kɛ kui̱dä moc rɔ bi̱i̱, kä bi ɣä lip guäth in mi̱ethä kä ma̱thä. Kä kɛ kɔrɛ bi kulɛ wä mi̱th kä mäthi’? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /ca jɛ dee la̱r tɛ̈th lɔaac kɛ ɣöö cɛ min ca la̱r jɛ la̱t? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amäni yɛn bä, mi cia tin diaal tin ca la̱r yɛ la̱t, la wä yɛn i̱, ‘Kɛ kɔn la̱a̱t ti thil luɔt, kɛ ɣöö cakɔ la̱t ni min dëëkɔ la̱t!’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jak Yecu wutni da̱ŋ wäl kä gɔw",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min wä Yecu kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, cuɛ rët kɛ rɛy rööl in te kam Tha-mɛ-ria kɛnɛ Gɛ̈-lɛ-li. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min wee rɛy wec, cu ji̱ dhɔapni da̱ŋ wäl ben kä jɛ. Cukɛ cuɔ̱ŋ a na̱n, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä cukɛ ciöt i̱, “Yecu, Kuäär, a lɔcdu kɔ̱c kɛ kɔ!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë cɛ kɛ nɛn, cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Wiaa nyuɔ̱thɛ pua̱nykun bööth palä.” Kä min wäkɛ cu pua̱nykiɛn cu gɔw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ram kɛl kä kɛ loc jɔk, mëë cɛ jɛ nɛn ɛn ɣöö ci puɔ̱nydɛ gɔaa, kä liakɛ Kuɔth kɛ jɔw mi di̱i̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ rɔɔdɛ yuɔr piny ciökni Yecu, kä cuɛ jɛ la̱r tɛ̈th lɔaac. Kä ram ɛmɔ ɛ raan Tha-mɛ-ria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yecu wee i̱, “/Cikɛ nɛy da̱ŋ wäl kɛn tin ci gɔw? Kä nɛy da̱ŋ bäŋuan anikä? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ thil ram kɛl mi cu luny jɔk mi dee Kuoth liak ɛ ni jur ɛmɛ kärɔa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Jiɛc rɔ, kä wër dupdu, ci ŋa̱thdu ji̱ jakä gɔaa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ben kuäärä Kuɔth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu tha̱a̱ŋ ji̱ Pa-ri-thii Yecu thiec kɛ gua̱a̱th in bi ben kɛ kuäär Kuɔth. Cuɛ kɛ loc i̱, “Kuäär Kuɔth /cɛ bi ben kɛ nyuuthni ti ba nɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /cikɛ bi wee i̱, ‘Nɛnɛ, jɛn ɛn,’ kiɛ ‘Jɛn ni!’ Kɛ ɣöö, ɛ puc, Kuäär Kuɔth a rɛydun.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yecu ji̱ kɔaarɛ jiök i̱, “Ci ni̱n thia̱k ti bia go̱r ɛn ɣöö bia cäŋ kɛl kä ni̱n Gatdä Ran nɛn, kä /ci yɛn ɛ bi nɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ba yɛ jiök i̱, ‘Guɛcɛ jɛ wanɛ mi!’ kiɛ ‘Guɛcɛ jɛ wanɛ mi!’ /Cuarɛ wä, kä /cuarɛ jɛ wä guic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ce̱tkɛ yiel nhial in la mɛr nhial kui̱cɔ kɛnɛ kui̱cɔ, ɛ jɛn bi ce̱tkɛ ta̱a̱ Gatdä Ran ɔ kɛ cäŋdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duundɛ ɣöö kɛ nhiam bɛ cuuc ɛlɔ̱ŋ, kä ba jɛ lo̱k ɛ ri̱c ɛmɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ce̱tkɛ ta̱a̱ ni̱ni Nowa ɛ jɛn ta̱a̱ in bi tekɛ ni̱n Gatdä Ran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë mi̱thkɛ kä mäthkɛ, kä cukɛ kuɛɛn, kä kuɛ̈n kɛ kɛ, amäni cäŋ ëë wä kɛ Nowa rɛy murkäbä, kä cu nyɔc ben kä cuɛ kɛ näk kɛn diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bɛ ce̱tnikɛ ni̱n Lɔt bä. Mëë ci mi̱th naath kä mäthkɛ, kä ko̱kɛ kä kɔakɛ ŋɔak, pi̱thkɛ kä la̱tkɛ tiec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ cäŋ ëë jiɛn kɛ Lɔt kä Thɔ-dɔm, cu mac kɛnɛ wäl mi kɛc ŋuänydɛ dɛ̈m nhial, kä cuɛ kɛn diaal näk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bɛ te inɔ bä kɛ cäŋ in bi jɔɔc kɛ Gat Ran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ, a ram mi te wi̱i̱ duëël nhial /ci lɛ ben piny, kɛ ɣöö bɛ kuakɛ ti te rɛy duëël ben ka̱m raar. Kä inɔ bä kä ram mi te rɛy kakä a jɛ /ci lɛ loc wi̱c. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiɛmɛ ciek Lɔt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nɛy tin görkɛ ɣöö ba tëkdiɛn yop bikɛ jɛ bath, kä nɛy ti tho̱p tëkdiɛn bɛ jɛ yop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän la̱rä jɛ yɛ, ɛn wäär ɛmɔ bi nɛy da̱ŋ rɛw tɔ̱ɔ̱c kɛɛl, ba kɛl naŋ kä bi min dɔ̱ŋ duɔth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi män da̱ŋ rɛw guär kɛɛl, ba kɛl naŋ kä bi min dɔ̱ŋ duɔth.” [ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi män da̱ŋ rɛw te rɛy kakä, ba kɛl naŋ kä bi min dɔ̱ŋ duɔth.]",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17:36",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tha̱a̱ŋ buɔkni tëë wal cikɛ cio̱o̱k ɛmɛ 36 mat thi̱n.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jaak Yecu thiec i̱, “Winith, Kuäär?” Kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Gua̱a̱th mi te duɔ̱ɔ̱r mi ci li̱w thi̱n, bi cor rɔ̱ dol thi̱n.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
